        "sha256": "79c1b0b631af79eaef127bdf075d678da52aa35853977351bcd9dffd32ccfdaa",
        "title": "Contracting authority",
        "text": "EN SL EN LOGIN Quick search ... FONT SIZE Use CTRL+ to enlarge CTRL- to minimise UPPER-CASE/LOWER-CASE Small UPPER-CASE STYLE Normal Bold CURSOR White cursor Black cursor TOPIC Bold Usual Link Bold Usual Link Bold Usual Link Bold Usual Link Bold Usual Link Bold Usual Link RESET SETTINGS Toggle navigation Contents Public procurement Legislation Usefull links Technical support Statist News ProfJN Izvedba postopkov v primerih naravnih nesreč Directorate About Osebna izkaznica Reports and statistics User help Joint public procurement Projects Register of economic operators (excluded from procurement procedures) Strateška politika JN Oddaljen dostop System Instructions Guidance and recommendations Legal protection Green public procurement e-JN content DJNews Profesionalization Online classrooms Contracting authority Tenderer Contracting authority Contracting authority The e-JN system fully supports the electronic execution of the procurement procedure, as well as the mere implementation of the public procurement process and is integrated into appropriate back-office systems. Electronic public procurement, in fact, makes it possible to achieve greater efficiency in procurement procedures, means improving its operations and ensuring the free movement of goods and services and the smooth functioning of the European Union's internal market. The process of informatization of public procurement processes due to the exchange of various electronic documents between different actors on the part of the contracting authorities and in connection with various business entities brings a great deal of complexity, which can be solved successfully through the e-Procurement project, which not only provides information support, specifications for document structures and training all actors, for electronic exchanges of documents. Operation E-Procurement affects the simplification and rationalization of procedures, increasing transparency, competitiveness and economy in the use of public funds, saving time, reducing costs and reducing administrative barriers. ADVANTAGES FOR CLIENTS Faster realization of orders, Reducing operating and administration costs by using electronic tools, More favorable prices, Standardization of procedures and greater transparency, Lower operational costs of individual delivery. Contract authority Are you a contracting authority? Register! More information Video materials, PDF materials, etc ... MORE Public procurement Legislation Usefull links Technical support Statist News ProfJN Izvedba postopkov v primerih naravnih nesreč Directorate About Osebna izkaznica Reports and statistics User help Joint public procurement Projects Register of economic operators (excluded from procurement procedures) Strateška politika JN Oddaljen dostop System Instructions Guidance and recommendations Legal protection Green public procurement e-JN content DJNews Profesionalization Online classrooms e-JN, version 4.14.0.0 Terms of use Privacy policy Accessibility statement Viber Whatsapp Ministry of the Interior and Public Administration ©2026 Support:ekc@gov.si, phone 080 2002 (Mon. till Fri. 8:00 - 22:00)",
